<title>USA: Superconductor Technologies CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Superconductor Technologies CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superconductor Technologies Inc said Tuesday that Daniel Hu recently resigned as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said it has named Peter Thomas to succeed Hu as president and chief executive, effective immediately. It said Thomas has served as president and chief executive of Ericsson North America Inc and president of ITT Telecom Networking Systems Division.</p>
<p>The company did not provide a reason for Hu's departure but said Hu would return to Silicon Valley and work in the semiconductor industry.</p>
</text>
